# Cloudflare Pages security headers
# 2026-05-09 Phase 1：codex 安全審查 #6 — 新增 CSP / 安全 headers
# 2026-05-16 Phase 2：完成拔除 script-src 'unsafe-inline'
#   - Batch 1-5: 清 HTML 內全部 inline onclick / 抽多餘 inline <script>，新增 ui-handlers.js
#     (data-action delegation) + per-page init.js
#   - Batch 7: 修 8 處 JS 內透過 innerHTML / insertAdjacentHTML render 的 dynamic onclick
#     (script.js ranking / pause、result-render match/compat、dashboard history) → delegation
#   - 本版 (Batch 6 v2): 拔 'unsafe-inline'、加 4 段 IAM inline 的 sha256 hash
#     * index.html / login.html / dashboard.html chiyigo token 接收 + JWKS 驗證
#     * frontchannel-logout.html OIDC front-channel single sign-out
#     任一段內容變動（含空白）必須在 _headers 同步重算 hash，否則該頁 inline 會被 CSP block。
# 2026-05-23 Phase 3：完成拔除 style-src 'unsafe-inline'
#   - 全站 9 個 HTML 59 處 inline style="..." 全搬到 feature-enhancements.css 的 utility/
#     semantic class（is-init-hidden / dash-section-h2 / jung-section-h2 / f-card--* /
#     stats-hint / u-mt-* / tx-* 等）
#   - 5 個 JS 16 處 template literal 內 style="..." 全砍：
#     · 靜態色/邊距 → CSS class
#     · 動態值 (width:${p}% / background:${color} / left:${x}% / animation-duration:${ms}ms)
#       → render 時用 data-* 屬性，innerHTML 後跑 querySelectorAll([data-*]) 走 element.style.x
#       = ... CSSOM 設值（CSP 不擋 CSSOM，只擋 inline style attribute）
#   - ui-handlers.js applyDataFillWidths() 通用 data-fill→width 初始化（mbti-stats 19 個 bar）
#
# 設計取捨：
#   - script-src 已無 'unsafe-inline'，剩 4 個 sha256 hash + CDN whitelist
#   - style-src 已無 'unsafe-inline'，純 'self'：所有靜態樣式走外部 CSS，所有動態樣式走 CSSOM
#   - frame-ancestors 允許 chiyigo.com：frontchannel-logout.html 被 chiyigo iframe 嵌入用
#   - connect-src 列 chiyigo.com：JWKS / OIDC discovery / token endpoint / refresh / claim
#   - GA / GTM 走 googletagmanager.com / google-analytics.com
#   - chart.js / chartjs-plugin-datalabels / html2canvas 走 cdn.jsdelivr.net + cdnjs.cloudflare.com
#     （connect-src 也要列，否則 DevTools 開著時 source map 抓取會被 CSP 擋）
#   - Cloudflare Web Analytics (Pages 平台自動注入 beacon.min.js)：
#     script-src + static.cloudflareinsights.com；connect-src + cloudflareinsights.com

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), payment=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'sha256-c8RKv/YB4reW+punVzHSIvJPFBWHE78Xvw14/fSWXgo=' 'sha256-OETcpSaEqGt5P1tkNQt8tPMKFzWBM/uXcTs6r0hjPOA=' 'sha256-jYXoCOFNegZQozmVqhHHpvDKm4SMh3QzbYXqAWTG2J8=' 'sha256-7j7d0TPGxZUuK/M2xLLMs9AMY3FsybSFuxEiW1jk8aI=' https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com https://www.googletagmanager.com https://www.google-analytics.com https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data: https:; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://chiyigo.com https://www.googletagmanager.com https://www.google-analytics.com https://cloudflareinsights.com https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com; frame-src 'self' https://chiyigo.com; frame-ancestors 'self' https://chiyigo.com; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self' https://chiyigo.com

# frontchannel-logout.html 必須允許被 chiyigo 主站 iframe 嵌入（OIDC front-channel logout）
# CSP 已含 frame-ancestors 'self' https://chiyigo.com，這裡 X-Frame-Options 覆蓋為 ALLOW-FROM 等價
/frontchannel-logout.html
  X-Frame-Options: ALLOW-FROM https://chiyigo.com
